message.content:
{
  "action": "film_Alma",
  "words": "I'm coming with you. Let's get to the Rialto before the lights go down.",
  "intention": "Capture Alma's voice and the final atmosphere of the Rialto for her daughter in Pittsburgh.",
  "detail": "I shoulder the camera, check the single remaining battery indicator, and head out the hotel door with Alma. The afternoon is open, and I decide the spectacle of the festival is less important than preserving a memory that will be lost forever once the theater closes. I will not film the party tonight; that memory will belong to the people there, but Alma's farewell needs to be recorded."
}
